# This CITATION.cff file describes the dataset in this repository (the
# Euclidean geometry ontology catalogs). To cite the accompanying article,
# use `preferred-citation` below.
# NOTE: add the Zenodo DOI under `identifiers` after the first archived release.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these catalogs, please cite both the dataset and the
  accompanying article (see preferred-citation).
type: dataset
title: "Euclidean Geometry Ontology Catalogs (Facts, Objects, and Methods)"
abstract: >-
  Annotation vocabularies of an ontology for Euclidean geometry problems and
  their solutions: 219 geometric facts, 143 geometric objects, and 97 solution
  methods, in English and Russian, with English-Russian translation tables and
  a worked solution-graph example. Developed in 1991-1996 by R.K. Gordin,
  M. Bouzinier, S. Trifonov, and I.F. Sharygin, and used since to annotate
  thousands of geometry problems in support of curriculum design and skill
  tracking.
authors:
